-- THE LABELS ARE THE WHOLE DIFFICULTY: matching on the metric NAME alone
-- reports "all fine" over a dashboard that has been blank for three weeks,
-- because the metric is perfectly alive and it is the label VALUE that went
-- away. Matcher 1 of s_canary_err is that case.

matcher_at[repo](s_api_rps,      1, "job", "api").
matcher_count[repo](s_api_rps,      1).
matcher_at[repo](s_api_lat,      1, "job", "api").
